Subject: [PATCH 1/2] refactor(sheet): one export per file; picker rules, link
 pills, one chip cluster, usePopover

The sheet's parts (U2, R1.1.11-R1.1.18, R1.1.20, R1.1.22). The picker's rules go to
use-picker/utils.ts (defaultSlot, movedOff, whomOf's tagged step, optionsOf, alonePicked), and
the picker is one file per component with useChoices and useAloneChoices. action-entry is split:
its rows, details and hooks in action-entry/, its chips in action-chips/ with ActionChips (its
damage inline or none, for the table) and UsesChips for the three chip and uses clusters, RowName
for the three name blocks and useActionMenu for the two identical row menus. Description links
are split with LinkPill for the save, check, formula and damage pills, and useLinkMenus,
useActionInfo, useItemMenu and useActionRows are .ts bridges. src/hooks/use-popover.ts places the
uses menu, the hit dice menu, the exact coin amount and the condition tooltip.

The rest is one export per file (action-info, hit-dice with useHitDiceChoice, uses-button with
useUsesStep, prompt-banner, spell-slots, item-menu, press-menu, sheet-text, effects-tab,
features-tab, actions-layout, actions-tab); drawDescription is a bridge to DescriptionHtml, whose
tags are drawn from a table; FS/utils/types.ts holds AloneChoice, and damage-alone no longer
re-exports alone-choices. Strings, classes, attribute order, ids and request bodies are as before;
tests change in import lines only.

U2's files: rule (a) 13 files and 105 findings to 0, named types 27 to 1 (SpellSlotPool, which
U1's charging/types.ts imports: a Phase 4 item), cognitive complexity over 15 from 6 to 0, the 4
floating-ui refs findings gone. L1 per item group (11, 12, 13-17, 18, 20-22): jest 305 suites and
9,689 tests green, tsc 0, eslint 0 errors and 661 to 520 warnings, gates 1-12 ok (3 cycle groups);
next build ok.

